      "normalizedSource": "A rule system calls this method when evaluating its rules, if and only if the rule’s predicate has been satisfied (that is, the [`evaluatePredicate(in:)`](gkrule/evaluatepredicate(in:).md) method has returned [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)), and after moving the rule from its [`agenda`](gkrulesystem/agenda.md) list to its [`executed`](gkrulesystem/executed.md) list.",
